          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga mundu akulombela mlumbugwe, kapena mwanace jwamkongwe jwa babagwe, kapena mwanace jwamkongwe jwa mamagwe, akwenela kupocela cilango ŵanaŵaŵili mpela muyikwenela kuŵela, pakwatesya soni pameso pa ŵandu ni kwatyosya mwikuga lya ŵandu. Ligongo lyakulombela alumbugwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
