              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.12+LEV.18.13+LEV.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lef 18:12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwamlume naga akugona ni ŵamkwawo alongo ajawo babagwe, kapena ŵamkwawo alumbu ŵawo mamagwe, ni kuti ŵasambwile alongo ajawo babagwe ni mamagwewo, tacitwicila ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wosope ŵanaŵaŵili, soni ngasakola ŵanace umi wawo wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga mundu jwamlume akulombela jwamkongwe jwa mlongo mjakwe, jwelejo atesile cindu cakunyalaya, soni amsambwile pakumwula mlongo mjakwejo, soni ŵanaŵaŵili ngasakola mwanace mpaka kuwa kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
