          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mundu jwalijose, jwamlume kapena jwamkongwe, jwakulondola yisango kwa misimu ja ŵandu ŵawe, kapena msaŵi, akwenela kuwulajidwa pakwaponya maganga. Jwakutenda yindu yeleyi akuliwulajisya msyene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.27",
